Package: econkit
Title: Economic Analysis Tools for Asset Management and Banking
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Stromberg", , "john.stromberg92@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Practical, reproducible macroeconomic analysis for asset
    management and banking. Provides a unified data layer (bundled sample
    data and FRED), frequency alignment and transformations, yield-curve
    recession probability models with leakage-free backtests, the Sahm rule,
    output gap estimation (Hamilton regression filter and Hodrick-Prescott),
    growth/inflation regime classification, Markov-switching regime models,
    and parameterised Quarto reporting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/john-stromberg/econkit
BugReports: https://github.com/john-stromberg/econkit/issues
